5. DATA AND PRIVACY

   On iOS, the Live Caller ID Lookup protocol is executed by the operating
   system using Oblivious HTTP, Privacy Pass, and homomorphic-encryption-based
   Private Information Retrieval. On Android, lookups use k-anonymous bucket
   retrieval. In both cases CallerAPI does not learn which phone number a device
   looks up. Licensee is responsible for its own Application's privacy
   disclosures, App Store and Google Play privacy labels, and compliance with
   applicable law in its markets.

